msgid "A reader's posts wait for a member until one of theirs is approved. Signed-in users of your app publish at once."
msgstr "Objave bralca čakajo na člana, dokler ni odobrena ena od njih. Prijavljeni uporabniki vaše aplikacije objavljajo takoj."

