msgid "Deletes the board with its ideas, votes, replies and stage history. Linked feedback stays, and its progress too. The public address stops working."
msgstr "Izbriše tablo z idejami, glasovi, odgovori in zgodovino faz. Povezane povratne informacije in njihov napredek ostanejo. Javni naslov preneha delovati."

